| Phase | Steps | Parallelizable? |
|---|---|---|
| 0 â€” Audit & contracts | 0.1â€“0.4 (4) | 0.3 can run alongside 0.1/0.2 |
| 1 â€” Canvas & persistence MVP | 1.1â€“1.7 (7) | 1.2 alongside 1.1/1.3 |
| 2 â€” Config & validation | 2.1â€“2.5 (5) | sequential; 2.5 after 2.1 |
| 3 â€” Execution | 3.1â€“3.6 (6) | 3.1 must land alone; 3.3/3.4 parallel after 3.2 |
| 4 â€” Partial runs & resilience | 4.1â€“4.4 (4) | 4.3 parallel with 4.2 |
| 5 â€” Power UX & expressions | 5.1â€“5.5 (5) | 5.1â€“5.3 parallelizable |

31 steps total. The critical path is 0.1 â†’ 0.2 â†’ 0.4 â†’ 1.2 â†’ 1.6 â†’ 3.1 â†’ 3.2 â†’ 3.3 â†’ 3.5 â†’ 3.6; everything else hangs off it. The two steps to treat with the most care are **3.1** (extracting step functions from the 2,400-line `routes.py` without behavior change) and **4.2** (cache correctness â€” wrong reuse silently corrupts projects).

